    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "When I'm typing something in insert mode and there's no completion available, the command line keeps saying `Scanning tags.`, which is really annoying. Would it be possible to get rid of this?",
    "closed_at": "2022-10-14T06:42:13Z",
