        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Another semi-solution that seems to \"work\" comes from [these comments](https://github.com/vim/vim/issues/3412#issuecomment-641041755):\r\n- `set showmode`.\r\n- `set shortmess+=c`.\r\n- \"Hide\" mode message by defining `hi ModeMsg guifg=<your background color> guibg=NONE gui=NONE`. This way it will be shown but not seen.",
            "created_at": "2021-10-19T10:52:01Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/5#issuecomment-946605235",
